##
    A file the tour reaches by name.

    The four files in the folder above compile as a unit, because naming any one of them
    gathers the ones beside it. This one is a folder down, so nothing gathers it and nothing
    reaches it until a file says which file it wants.
##

model Units

    public shared real function Inches(real centimeters)
        yield centimeters / 2.54;
    end function

    public shared real function Centimeters(real inches)
        yield inches * 2.54;
    end function

end model
